1y75|n|One who strains. ; That through which any liquid is passed for purification or to separate it from solid matter; anything, as a screen or a cloth, used to strain a liquid; a device of the character of a sieve or of a filter; specifically, an openwork or perforated screen, as for the end of the suction pipe of a pump, to prevent large solid bodies from entering with a liquid.	a:192w,110,4;tl5,68,3~192w,110,4;tl5,68,3	n:1dti,88,4;tl5,78,6~tl5,78,6;1dti,88,4	N:m5f,99,4~m5f,99,4
