1yl8|n|An instrument for writing. See Style, n., 1. ; That needle-shaped part at the tip of the playing arm of phonograph which sits in the groove of a phonograph record while it is turning, to detect the undulations in the phonograph groove and convert them into vibrations which are transmitted to a system (since 1920 electronic) which converts the signal into sound; also called needle. The stylus is frequently composed of metal or diamond. ; The needle-like device used to cut the grooves which record the sound on the original disc during recording of a phonograph record. ; A pen-shaped pointing device used to specify the cursor position on a graphics tablet.	a:11s5,80,5;66b,60,1;gja,53,4;mjp,47,2;21y2,41,3;wq,31,9;1wie,27,5;1egm,22,8;6gk,18,3;22wa,7,1~wq,31,9;1egm,22,8;1wie,27,5;11s5,80,5;gja,53,4;21y2,41,3;6gk,18,3;mjp,47,2;22wa,7,1;66b,60,1	V:jbj,37,3;qk9,22,3;2973,7,3;297a,2,4~297a,2,4;jbj,37,3;2973,7,3;qk9,22,3	n:vuv,108,3;11s5,83,6;66b,76,3;1h9a,68,14;20hb,62,16;iom,30,3;179a,20,7;22wa,17,2~20hb,62,16;1h9a,68,14;179a,20,7;11s5,83,6;vuv,108,3;66b,76,3;iom,30,3;22wa,17,2	N:1hcy,91,3;p71,91,8;1ihf,60,27;zf5,57,137;9uk,49,12;4fp,40,17;1h9a,30,1;dvr,24,4;1abn,13,9;jma,12,11;1e9k,2,4~zf5,57,137;1ihf,60,27;4fp,40,17;9uk,49,12;jma,12,11;1abn,13,9;p71,91,8;1e9k,2,4;dvr,24,4;1hcy,91,3;1h9a,30,1
1yl8|a|An instrument for writing. See Style, n., 1. ; That needle-shaped part at the tip of the playing arm of phonograph which sits in the groove of a phonograph record while it is turning, to detect the undulations in the phonograph groove and convert them into vibrations which are transmitted to a system (since 1920 electronic) which converts the signal into sound; also called needle. The stylus is frequently composed of metal or diamond. ; The needle-like device used to cut the grooves which record the sound on the original disc during recording of a phonograph record. ; A pen-shaped pointing device used to specify the cursor position on a graphics tablet.	j:1h9a,46,3;22fu,46,5;1drt,35,4;22wa,17,2;1zml,5,3~22fu,46,5;1drt,35,4;1zml,5,3;1h9a,46,3;22wa,17,2
